{"id":"vod_sn_39285","vodId":"39285","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"URAHARA","name_cn":"URAHARA","date":"2017-01-01","year":"2017","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/58e743431911113b3a94acd5c3e2aa99.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在车水马龙充满了无数时尚潮流元素的原宿。在这里，有一间名为“PARK”的商店。温柔体贴不善于表达自己的感情的须藤璃都（春奈露娜 配音）、极具个性拥有自己的主见不轻易动摇的白子真理（上坂堇 配音）和智商超高容易陷进自己的世界之中无法自拔的绵䌷琴子（石见五菜香 配音）共同经营着这间商店。　　让三人没有想到的是，有一天，竟然真的发生了外星人进攻地球的戏码，不仅如此，人类还处于劣势，险些一败涂地。这时，一位名叫丸野美沙（天野心爱 配音）的神秘少女出现在了三人的面前，非常热爱原宿风格的她以及三名少女，似乎成为了人类最后的希望。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:08:54","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/AtpXDMKZCA1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/iGDZ1rpJJn1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Gc5w39kpQX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/B9BpUkqdsS1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/rHwhq6p1pG1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/GbmrirQ2PK1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/nw2fSY6kCd1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/HWeBz7q6Ga1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/qUg46mHLwC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ZKbiBCuN0K1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/u6ABfYCrfR1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/c2TFNUrzWp1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:48.369Z"}